      <title>현대 과학·종교논쟁</title>
      <link>https://ezaurum.com/2013/06/%ED%98%84%EB%8C%80-%EA%B3%BC%ED%95%99%EC%A2%85%EA%B5%90%EB%85%BC%EC%9F%81/</link>
